  * one targetless READY notification (token 0, width/height 0) after a valid
  * current frame has been submitted back to the inline swapchain. This lets a
  * compatibility renderer remain visible until inline restoration is real.
+ *
+ * INLINE_FRESH_FRAME also emits one targetless READY notification, but never
